    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>A simple &quot;Failed Actor Cannot Load&quot; bug occurred which is within data that I cannot alter, nor can I decrypt. Therefore, I won't be able to fix the bug at the tutorial of the game which disallows further progress. </strong><br><strong> </strong><br><strong>Perhaps symbolic of my inability to create a completely non-violent game without any horror moments, because this game is now lost to time. I can't load the file any longer and won't be able to fix that bug, because their is a bug within loading the game itself that cannot be easily solved. This is like a silver arrow to my soul to be quite honest because that game took me years of toil and complication. I felt like it was my greatest piece of art, but to be honest, it wasn't quite original enough and so now I will have to bank of my new game if I ever come the timeline where that is needed, which will contain a far greater example of what Art needs to evolve into anyways. </strong><br><strong> </strong><br><strong>This creation was only meant for the esoteric few. If you played this game or can record yourself playing through the game, please keep any positive memories alive! Forgive me for this. Thank you. </strong><br> <br> <br> <br>Philosophical Modern/Sci-fi Story Driven RPG </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;Vidya&quot; a technology that is introduced to a planet named &quot;Gaia&quot;. Many people enjoy playing with this technology. Some however, believe it contains a mysterious power beyond what people normally perceive... </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Your phone begins to ring. It appears to be an anonymous caller:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Anonymous:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;Vidya will evolve&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;Gaia will transform&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;Mr. Carnelian will change everything&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Tick Tock... Tick Tock...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Discover the true nature of &quot;Vidya&quot; a technology introduced to Gaia by an unknown cause</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Verbal Encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Designed to be a modern day RPG taking place in a reality, parallel to our own</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Features a soundtrack of Vaporwave/NewWaveRetro artists such as:  \u732b \u30b7 Corp, Windows\u5f6196, Isidor, Efence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Explore the metaphysics of consciousness, the examination of our society, and what real magic is<br><br><br><br>Are you playing a video game, or are you really playing with Vidya?</p></li></ul>",
