 everything&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Tick Tock... Tick Tock...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Discover the true nature of &quot;Vidya&quot; a technology introduced to Gaia by an unknown cause</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Verbal Encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Designed to be a modern day RPG taking place in a reality, parallel to our own</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Features a soundtrack of Vaporwave/NewWaveRetro artists such as:  \u732b \u30b7 Corp, Windows\u5f6196, Isidor, Efence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    Explore the metaphysics of consciousness, the examination of our society, and what real magic is<br><br><br><br>Are you playing a video game, or are you really playing with Vidya?</p></li></ul>",
